{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06ECD0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"CIA交给你的资料里，有Shagohod的数据吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":53,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"Shagohod？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":11,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"一种发射IRBM的核武装坦克。当时它和Granin的系统竞争过采用资格。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"啊，就是那个带火箭的家伙。设计者好像叫Sokolov……呵呵。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"有什么好笑的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"没什么，只是想起Granin在Shagohod资料上写过分析。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":65,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"写得可难听了。什么“保守”、“庸俗”之类的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"想也知道。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"他大概气坏了，墨水都晕得很厉害。偏偏那边的纸本来质量就差。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……是啊。确实很像他。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"为了延长IRBM的射程，把坦克本身加速到时速500公里……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":76,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"虽然荒唐，却又够豪迈。居然把坦克当成火箭第一级来用，真有苏联风格。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"其实我开发Pupa时，也参考过Shagohod。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"那个悬浮兵器？这也是抄来的？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"太失礼了。我参考的只是概念，技术可是原创的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"不过悬浮方式终究没法完美应对中美洲的地形。说到底，还是一种靠蛮力的兵器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"但Shagohod确实很有威胁。它出乎意料地灵活，而且相当结实。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":80,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"你还真了解。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"那家伙可让我吃了不少苦。想忘都忘不了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"吃了不少苦？……这么说，打倒Shagohod的人也是你？真没想到，你还真厉害。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":101,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"不是我一个人打倒的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"不，我还是得谢谢你。如果Shagohod被量产，现在这个世界说不定已经不存在了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"不过现在核弹头也越来越小型化。我想已经不需要Shagohod那种加速坦克了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":98,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"这可没什么值得高兴的。也就是说，现在已经能从任何地方向全世界发射核武了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""}]}